{'symbol': 'RHI', 'date': '2021-04-07 09:03:00', 'title': "PROTIVITI LAUNCHES 'BIRDIES FOR MEALS' CAMPAIGN WITH PROFESSIONAL GOLFERS MATT FITZPATRICK AND JENNIFER KUPCHO TO FIGHT HUNGER", 'text': 'MENLO PARK, CALIF., APRIL 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PROTIVITI WILL DONATE UP TO 100,000 MEALS TO NON-PROFIT FEEDING CHILDREN EVERYWHERE BASED ON THE TOTAL NUMBER OF BIRDIES MADE BY GOLF PROS MATT FITZPATRICK AND JENNIFER KUPCHO DURING THE 2021 MAJOR CHAMPIONSHIPS.'}